        "textfield": "here is a basic demo of banger\n\nin the banger act, you see the the internal \"metro\" is set to \"use\", meaning the banger's\ninternal metro is on.  the metro slider is for ms, in this case 400 ms\n\nin the grid, metro blinks everytime there's a bang.  to the right are where you can configure\nmessage to be received by control@\n\nthe header row is for the ms to delay the bang.  so we send 2 bangs -- 1) delayed 0 seconds and 2) delayed 200 seconds\n\nin control@'s [routing] window, we've set these bangs from banger to sinus::bang-env using \"valON\" mode",
